      Screen printing provides bold designs with limited colors at cost-effective pricing for large runs. This traditional method works well for training tops, practice gear, and promotional sportswear where simple designs with 1-6 colors are sufficient. Screen printing offers excellent durability and vibrant colors on polyester fabrics.
    </p>
    
    <p style="color:#FFFFFF;max-width:800px;line-height:1.8;font-size:0.95rem;margin-top:1rem;">
      Embroidery delivers a premium look that works particularly well on polo-style sportswear and outerwear. This three-dimensional decoration adds perceived value and is ideal for corporate team uniforms, golf apparel, and premium athletic wear where brand presentation is paramount. Our <a href="/embroidery-service" style="color:#e00;text-decoration:underline;">embroidery service</a> offers various thread types and stitch patterns.
