    </div>
    
    <div style="max-width:800px;">
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">What is the minimum order for custom sportswear?</h3>
