        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">We manufacture football jerseys, basketball uniforms, soccer kits, rugby shirts, tennis apparel, cricket whites, athletic shorts, tracksuits, training gear, warm-up suits, and custom team uniforms for all sports.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Can you customize sportswear with team logos and numbers?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Yes. We offer sublimation printing, screen printing, embroidery, heat transfer, and vinyl numbering for team customization. Custom logos, player names, numbers, and sponsor branding available.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">What performance fabrics do you use for sportswear?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">We use moisture-wicking polyester, breathable mesh, 4-way stretch fabrics, anti-odor treatments, UV protection fabrics, and quick-dry materials. All fabrics designed for athletic performance and durability.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">How long does custom sportswear production take?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Standard production timeline: 30-40 days from fabric receipt for basic sportswear. 35-50 days for custom fabric development or specialized performance fabrics. 7-14 days for sampling before bulk.</p>
