      <div style="padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Do you offer sublimation printing for jerseys?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Yes. Full sublimation printing for unlimited colors and complex designs. Sublimation is permanent, breathable, and doesn't crack or peel. Ideal for team jerseys with intricate patterns and gradients.</p>
